*********SET-INTERFACE***********

- Set interface is part of java collection framework
- Set Interface doesnot allowed duplicate values.
- Does not Maintain Insertion order Except - LinkedHashSet Class

java.lang.Iterable<E>
   └── java.util.Collection<E>
       └── java.util.Set<E>        // Set Interface
           ├── HashSet<E>         // Unordered, fast lookup
           ├── LinkedHashSet<E>   // Ordered, maintains insertion order
           ├── TreeSet<E>         // Sorted, uses Red-Black tree







